  "details": "Currently, you can either line up your view ball with your eyes, or with your avatar ears, but typically not both at the same time, which creates a weirdly uncomfortable disconnect for audio-sensitive users where what they see and what they hear doesn't match up.\n\nI understand this is hardly a priority, but being able to decouple the two would probably not break anything and slightly enhance immersion on a lot of avatars.",
